  "title": "Hagerty Named Official Enthusiast Car Insurance Partner for Barrett-Jackson’s Premier Automotive Lifestyle Events - Hagerty",
  "summary": "TRAVERSE CITY, Mich. – June 9, 2026 – Barrett-Jackson (https://www.barrett-jackson.com/), The World’s Greatest Collector Car Auctions, today announced that Hagerty, a business built by drivers for drivers, has been named the official enthusiast car insurance partner for its premier automotive lifestyle events. This strategic partnership unites two of the most iconic names in the automotive world to provide […]",
